      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXTRA CHILL (6) looks well placed in this easier grade. Last couple have been in town in far richer company, the latest beaten only a few lengths. Far easier here and gets chance. DIDACTIC (1) was well fancied at Murray Bridge last time in maiden grade and led throughout, lifting strongly to get off the mark. Expected to give a sight again. LAFONT (7) is another coming off city form. Finished runner-up last time behind Mr Trafficanti and in the process beat home EXTRA CHILL. Will get back but has been winding up strongly and looks suited by the extra ground. TERMINAL SHOCK (8) found the line strongly last time and is worth following up. EMPIRESTATEOFMIND (2) is better than last run and gets a chance to atone.",
